      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## D4b - LinkedIn jobs (Apify harvestapi/linkedin-job-search)\nSelf-draining: claims up to account_limit alive accounts (intel_accounts_for_jobs stamps jobs_attempted_at), 10 companies per Apify call, posted in the past month, raw rows → account_intel.jobs_raw → intel_apply_jobs maps to account_intel.jobs with the signal flags (contract, visa, on-site, IT, People, remote).\n\n$1 per 1,000 jobs. Re-runs weekly (6-day claim window).",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
